sequenceDiagram
  participant GW as API gateway (ClientProxy)
  participant B as Transport (Redis, NATS, RMQ, Kafka, gRPC)
  participant S as Orders microservice
  GW->>B: send("order.create", payload)
  B->>S: @MessagePattern("order.create")
  S-->>B: reply
  B-->>GW: Observable emits result
  GW->>B: emit("order.created", event)
  B->>S: @EventPattern("order.created")
  Note over GW,S: emit is fire-and-forget, no reply
